DST_LOBBY_DEL_CHARACTER="[align = ""center""][font size = ""12"" color=""f4d762""]删除角色[/font][br][br][font size = ""10"" color=""f36a7c""]为了游戏安全，请输入游戏密码确认。[/font][br][br][font size = ""10"" color=""f36a7c""]※请注意!!输入密码前，请先解开通讯锁※[/font][br][br][font size = ""10"" color=""f36a7c""]遭删除的角色将无法轻易复原，[br]请慎重考虑。[/font][br][br][font size = ""10"" color=""ffffff""]您要删除角色吗？[/font]"
